---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main class="min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24 px-6 md:px-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-sans text-text-secondary">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif text-text-primary mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
      <p>Last updated: May 3, 2026</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-text-primary mt-8 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By joining the Maestro waitlist, you agree to receive communications regarding our product launch, updates, and early access opportunities.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-text-primary mt-8 mb-4">2. Waitlist Conditions</h2>
      <p>Joining the waitlist does not guarantee immediate access to the platform upon launch. We reserve the right to admit users in batches to ensure platform stability and optimal learning experience.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-text-primary mt-8 mb-4">3. User Conduct</h2>
      <p>You agree to provide a valid email address. We reserve the right to remove any entries that appear to be spam, automated bots, or otherwise violate the spirit of our community.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-medium text-text-primary mt-8 mb-4">4. Modifications</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms or the nature of the Maestro service at any time without prior notice.</p>

      <p class="mt-12 text-sm">If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at legal@maestro.com.</p>
      
      <div class="mt-12">
        <a href="/" class="text-accent-primary hover:text-accent-glow no-underline">&larr; Back to home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
